></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>装备系统 🛡️</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >装备体系在传统传奇装备（屠龙、嗜魂法杖等）之上，增加了大量龙珠主题装备🗡️🔮。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>三、 总结 🎉</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >传奇七龙珠版本是一款极具想象力的创新玩法。它成功地将两款经典IP的优点结合：</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >传奇的PVP核心与社交体系（沙巴克攻城、行会战）🏰👥。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >龙珠的成长感与爆发力（收集龙珠、变身、释放气功波）🔮💥。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >它满足了玩家在熟悉的世界里追求更高层次力量巅峰的梦想——想象一下，在沙巴克战场上，一个“超级赛亚人”战士顶着金光，一发出龟派气功轰倒一片敌人的场景🦸‍♂️💥，这种体验是原版传奇无法提供的。对于既喜欢传奇又热爱龙珠的玩家来说，这无疑是一个不容错过的神奇版本🎮🌟。</p>", "short_description": "耗时两年精心雕琢，倾尽心血打造诚意巨献！《圣域传奇：永恒之战》以原创剧情为灵魂的基础上，深度植入了日本动漫《七龙珠》的元素💫，它保留了传奇的核心玩法（打怪、升级、爆装备、攻沙巴克）超级大陆为舞台🏰，秉持“不肝不氪”的友好理念💖，同时增加了龙珠系统、气功波、战斗力、赛亚人变身等独具特色的新内容，让游戏体验既怀旧又新奇", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955930/8a172f89f27fd4f5de83f827a6eccbf71ff920d0/header.jpg?t=1767684335", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955930/e43b2a311f5b290db7f87c8bb2ed3bd7781397dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767684335", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955930/e43b2a311f5b290db7f87c8bb2ed3bd7781397dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767684335", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 &amp;Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br><